					"content": "没关系、没关系…我稍微，歇一下就好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030805,
					"content": "对不起，拉娜姐姐…对不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030806,
					"content": "真是的…都说了，没事的啦！不过，拉娜姐姐很生气哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030807,
					"content": "明明答应了姐姐…不要到森林里来…都说好了的。等拉娜姐姐，休息好了，一定要好好教训你这个不听话的…坏家伙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030808,
					"content": "呜呜…我只是之前听艾方索哥哥说，这边有很大的蘑菇！我想给姐姐采一些新鲜的蘑菇，姐姐吃了，就会很有精神…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030809,
					"content": "笨蛋…真是多此一举，拉娜姐姐只要想着大家，就会很有精神…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030810,
					"content": "不过，哈哈哈…这里的蘑菇，真的好大…如果拿去煮咖喱，一定很好吃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030811,
					"content": "是艾方索让你来的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030812,
					"content": "不是…艾方索哥哥也说，不要随便跑到外面去。不过，优丹就是想要拉娜姐姐吃好吃的…所以…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030813,
					"content": "艾方索才不会做这种事情，他可是优丹的哥哥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030814,
					"content": "也是…不过，优丹又怎么会困在死域里呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030815,
					"content": "在林子里，我觉得好像有人跟着我…我好害怕，我觉得是「无留陀的化身」…我就一直跑…呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030816,
					"content": "结果，就跑到了「无留陀」里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030817,
					"content": "？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030818,
						730030823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030818,
					"content": "「无留陀」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030819,
					"content": "也就是…死域。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030820,
					"content": "啊…对，就是死域。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030821,
					"content": "「无留陀的化身」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030822
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030822,
					"content": "嗯。也就是替代无留陀在大地上，做坏事的…黑黑的、高高的东西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030828,
					"content": "无留陀…好奇怪的名字。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030829,
					"content": "嗯，为什么我会知道无留陀就是死域…？可恶…头好晕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030830,
					"content": "刚刚，优丹，那个绿色的是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030831,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030832,
					"content": "是「兰迦拉梨」…可以保护人，不被无留陀侵蚀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030833,
					"content": "搞不明白的东西越来越多了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030834
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030834,
					"content": "这个是…一种森林的「法术」，也是一种「音乐」…这是兰…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030835,
						730030837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030835,
					"content": "是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030836
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030836,
					"content": "别想这些有的没的，拉娜你好好休息一会！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030838,
					"content": "就快要想起来了，但就是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030839,
					"content": "对不起，拉娜姐姐，对不起…以后我不会乱跑的，会好好呆在家里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030840,
					"content": "嗯，姐姐知道啦。你要变得聪明、健康，知道什么是好的，什么是不好的…就像，你知道什么蘑菇能吃、什么不能吃一样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030841,
					"content": "我知道…我知道了啦…对不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030842,
					"content": "#知道「无留陀」不好，然后…森林是好的…变成强壮、正直的人，帮助需要帮助的人…像{NICKNAME}和派蒙那样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030843,
					"content": "然后，不要忘记…森林会记住一切…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030844,
					"content": "呜哇，不行，我觉得拉娜状态越来越差了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030845,
						730030846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030845,
					"content": "我们去找人帮忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030847
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030847,
					"content": "哎？啊…没关系，没关系…我休息一下就好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030848
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030848,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，拜托你…替我把优丹送回去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030849
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030849,
					"content": "嗯，我们走吧，优丹。拉娜，你别乱跑！我们马上回来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030846,
					"content": "拉娜，等我们一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030847
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030837,
					"content": "别想这些了，休息一下。",
